OL,3,APM Andy Burnham proposes national care
OL,4,Aservice to tackle 'threadbare' social
OL,5,Acare system
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is fielding questions on
OL,8,FSunday with Laura Kuenssberg - watch
OL,9,Flive above
OL,11,FBurnham says the government will
OL,12,Fintroduce a universal national care
OL,13,Fservice to fix the current "threadbare"
OL,14,Fsystem
OL,16,FHe is also set to introduce a new
OL,17,Fscheme to help first-time buyers onto
OL,18,Fthe housing ladder, as he prepares for
OL,19,Fhis first Labour Party conference as
OL,20,Fprime minister in Liverpool
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
